## §12. `barstate.isconfirmed` Semantics Shift

Every `barstate.isconfirmed`-gated block in M5–M10 today means "this chart bar is
confirmed." Under this architecture it must instead mean "this 5-minute bar is confirmed" —
a related but distinct condition the Data Layer is responsible for supplying (§2's "5m
confirmation state" field, §7), not something M5–M10 compute for themselves. This is a
boundary clarification, not a change to any M5–M10 function's internal logic once it
receives that signal correctly.

